Z||000017||kslish||06-26-2001||03:31 PM||||I saw the coverage on eXtra.  Of course, to play it up they were trying to pin it on the release of "The Fast and the Furious" which kind of annoyed me.  <P>If it was teenage ricers totalling their Civics and Eclipses okay, but I would assume that the drivers of the Lambo and Vette were much older (since they were married and how many young people have the $$$ to drive these kind of cars).  <P>I hate it when the press twists a story and puts a spin on it.<P>The Diablo was a pretty big mess though...it appears that it was the car that t-boned the Volvo.<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>Ken S.<BR>'87GT and '86SC<BR>See them at <A HREF="http://homepage.mac.com/kjslish/Fiero.html" TARGET=_blank>http://homepage.mac.com/kjslish/Fiero.html</A><BR>Western PA Fiero Club - <A HREF="http://www.westpennfiero.org" TARGET=_blank>www.westpennfiero.org</A>||||reg||1
